AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/Provisional> "provisional"@en-us)
ClassAssertion(<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/MaturityLevel> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/Provisional>)

